    <section>
        <h2>Short FAQs</h2>
        <p><strong>Do I really need a SUBE card?</strong><br>
        Yes, you should get one early. You can pay on more AMBA bus lines with contactless options as of January 2026, but SUBE still gives you the most consistent coverage and fare structure.</p>
        
        <p><strong>Does registering SUBE matter?</strong><br>
        Yes. The City publishes higher Subte fares for an unregistered SUBE.</p>
        
        <p><strong>Is a digital nomad residence a real pathway in Argentina?</strong><br>
        Yes. Migraciones publishes a transitory residence route for digital nomads and explains the process and extension requirements.</p>
        
        <p><strong>Should I sign a long-term lease immediately?</strong><br>
        Not in week one. Live in the city first, learn micro-areas, then commit.</p>
        
        <p><strong>Can I work from cafés all day?</strong><br>
        You can, but you will work better if you combine cafés with coworking, especially for calls and deep work.</p>
    </section>

